 *
 * Usage:
 * 1. Use the starwind cli to add this component: `npx starwind@latest add @starwind-pro/blog-02`
 * 2. Import the `Blog2` component and pass your posts array
 *
 * Props:
 * - label: string (default: "Our blog")
 * - heading: string (default: "Blog posts to help you...")
 * - posts: BlogPost[] (required) - First post is featured
 * - class: string
 */
